    "detailed_description": "The king declares that whoever defeats him in battle will have their wish granted.<br>\u2588\u2588\u2588 is, like many others, a jobless robot that wants to use the wish to turn its life around.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stylish Roguelike Action</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/219e19f28aa0161a18ee3fe2fd820976.poster.avif?t=1748538066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/219e19f28aa0161a18ee3fe2fd820976.webm?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/219e19f28aa0161a18ee3fe2fd820976.mp4?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experiment and style on your enemies using the weapons you find each run, restarting over again with each death.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stronger One Sticker At A Time</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e0ab44ae4f5a83117939b0608d587cf2.poster.avif?t=1748538066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e0ab44ae4f5a83117939b0608d587cf2.webm?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/e0ab44ae4f5a83117939b0608d587cf2.mp4?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Shake up the game and grow more powerful with each sticker you find, increasing your evasion or becoming a glass cannon. Heck, why not both?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Same Place, But... Different</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.poster.avif?t=1748538066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.webm?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.mp4?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>All roads lead to the king's tower. Areas are randomly selected with different paths to take for each run.",
