70/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.poster.avif?t=1748538066\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.webm?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492070/extras/d74be1d4bf82e0f3e66edd45af3c9935.mp4?t=1748538066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>All roads lead to the king's tower. Areas are randomly selected with different paths to take for each run.",
